# bf16; the settings; 2 / 3 / 4 ranks over gloo in the interpreter, p2p and all-gather: unsplit, split, micro-batch
# halves, own-row front with layer-sliced halves leave the same bits, fp32 split == unsplit and differs from bf16, p2p
# sends exactly half the partials' bytes less; the full matrix with TF_SLOW_TESTS=1) and tests/cpu/test_ring_inplace.py
# (rings of 3 to 6 ranks, mixed dtypes and odd sizes: in place == the steps byte for byte, no local copy in place).
#
